{"obsah":"<p>At a day's notice we were asked for an exhibition at the traditional Nursery School Olympics in Prague, hosted by the school and nursery in Měcholupy. The organisation was in the hands of Radek Zavřel from the Czech Olympic Committee, so we knew what we were getting into. Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček took on the show, and since the event was for nurseries, he also brought his youngest rider Marty Kabeláč (with a proper excuse note for nursery, of course).</p>\n\n<p>The kids gave it their all, and after their performance Vlasta and Márty showed them a bit of Trial art on the trailer and obstacles. Vlasta rode on top of them, Márty rode under them, and the teachers wanted to take Márty into their class straight away :)</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FOlympiada-Skolek3.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FOlympiada-Skolek3.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208913\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FOlympiada-Skolek1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FOlympiada-Skolek1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208914\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FOlympiada-Skolek2.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FOlympiada-Skolek2.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208912\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FF39BDC1C-8D14-4D28-9459-FA901F33F3C3.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FF39BDC1C-8D14-4D28-9459-FA901F33F3C3.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208916\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F770829D3-D7E5-4CEF-A39B-6B0FF192CFCA.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2F770829D3-D7E5-4CEF-A39B-6B0FF192CFCA.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208917\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FA9DEA084-F62A-4DE5-8EA3-FF14735CAF27.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FA9DEA084-F62A-4DE5-8EA3-FF14735CAF27.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208915\"/></a></figure>\n</figure>"}